From d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d2e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bare Browser <noreply@localhost>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:33:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 74/75] Allow incognito screenshots with shake and watermark

Enables screen capturing in Incognito mode with gesture trigger and watermark:

- Eliminates unconditional FLAG_SECURE window restriction in incognito tabs,
  making screenshot capturing user-configurable in Privacy settings.
- Shake to Screenshot in Incognito: Shaking the device while viewing an incognito
  tab captures an instant screenshot of the page without opening DevTools.
- Stylized subtle watermark: Stamps a semi-transparent incognito icon in the corner
  of the captured PNG to preserve privacy aesthetics.
- Saves snapshots directly to the device Downloads directory with instant haptic
  feedback and notification.
